                "entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                "word": "merdia",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f614c453-c9b5-43bf-9e66-24e976eb25d1",
                        "entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "merdias"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                        "entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Médias considérés comme serviles, partiaux et soumis au pouvoir politique ou au pouvoir de ses propriétaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b9c84ac-606f-4351-86a1-97efc1c6a1d0",
                                "sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                                "text": "Mais les dirigeants de la pensée humaine, et j’en accuse les médias, (le mot de merdias serait préférable) ne veulent à aucun prix que l’Amour soit l’homme, car ils perdraient alors leur terrible pouvoir de manipulation qui réduit leurs semblables à une indigence de cœur propice à toutes les exploitations utilitaires et cyniques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1decce17-162e-4762-92eb-23cb1c24bc5d",
                                "sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                                "text": "Les merdias occidentaux encore pris en flagrant délit de propagande."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5a219a4-fb06-4f8f-858a-51a833a3b425",
                        "source_entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                        "source_sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Lügenpresse",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Lügenpresse",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91f3102b-0d1b-3b25-a6a8-d920b795ad06",
                                        "entry_id": "49c3c7be-effa-3403-8100-c6e7baa83fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gesamtheit der Journalisten und Zeitungsverlage, die eine andere politische Meinung vertreten und daher pauschal bezichtigt werden, die Unwahrheit zu verbreiten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffe5ae8a-26a9-43a5-892a-679b5505824b",
                                                "sense_id": "91f3102b-0d1b-3b25-a6a8-d920b795ad06",
                                                "text": "Bundespräsident Joachim Gauck zur Feier des 60-jährigen Bestehens des Deutschen Presserates: „Was dagegen Lügenpresse wirklich bedeutet, meine Damen und Herren, ich weiß es nun wirklich, den ich habe es erlebt, jahrzehntelang in der DDR. Ich weiß, was das ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad89998b-06c2-419b-9397-7e838c2b4b76",
                                                "sense_id": "91f3102b-0d1b-3b25-a6a8-d920b795ad06",
                                                "text": "„In sozialen Medien und Blogosphere, aber auch in politischen Bewegungen wie Pegida wird als Ausdruck pauschaler Medienkritik häufig das Schlagwort Lügenpresse eingesetzt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bb1f5c0-d4c6-437d-bafc-3d48eb212014",
                                                "sense_id": "91f3102b-0d1b-3b25-a6a8-d920b795ad06",
                                                "text": "Nach einer Umfrage des Forsa-Institutes stimmen 44 Prozent der Befragten ganz oder in Teilen zu, es gebe eine \"Lügenpresse\", wie es die Pegida-Bewegung behauptet. Medienexperten prüfen, was daran wahr sein könnte."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e81093c-9dfa-4bdc-8d76-1d180ff3cbc1",
                        "source_entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                        "source_sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Systempresse",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dc9972d1-06c3-41d3-9c59-5a64d60c633a",
                        "source_entry_id": "a34af274-e244-3179-b72c-b596f3833e11",
                        "source_sense_id": "c3c43b0b-b50a-3680-8fd7-9a2b80300af9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pravda",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pravda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f634e07-1bf0-3ea4-9cf5-6d2413465ce5",
                                        "entry_id": "4b255d74-f119-3f2c-9022-62d931f67463",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The official newspaper of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union, and successor papers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1abb833c-6ca9-4e06-99e0-3d7ad4d72504",
                                                "sense_id": "7f634e07-1bf0-3ea4-9cf5-6d2413465ce5",
                                                "text": "These figures indicate that there must have been considerable wastage in the past; indeed Pravda said that “no deviation from these standards is to be permitted, however slight, and it is the duty of Party workers in factories to exercise their rights of supervision to eliminate waste.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35a30590-91ee-32a1-a000-ba274d62bc68",
                                        "entry_id": "4b255d74-f119-3f2c-9022-62d931f67463",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pravda.ru, a privately owned Russian news website established in 1999."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aba1e2c1-6dbf-4750-a30b-8bd2e77e254a",
                                                "sense_id": "35a30590-91ee-32a1-a000-ba274d62bc68",
                                                "text": "Pravda has described Tony Abbott as “a disturbed mind crying out for therapy”: after his threat to “shirtfront” the Russian president, Vladimir Putin, in Brisbane."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pravda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                        "entry_id": "b3be31dd-1965-3d91-9b9d-07f0ed4513b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A newspaper or other media channel seen as untrustworthy and biased towards its owners or the establishment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61423324-dd0e-48c4-a36b-9076f07038ee",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "The fundamental purpose of the Government in introducing this measure, and in turning their three kept newspapers — the three Pravdas of Fianna Fail — to the propaganda campaign, is to wipe out the Labour Party, Clann na Talmhan, Clann na Poblachta and the Independents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f4e982e-ac08-4d0f-89b0-4670b82d5d1e",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "The music press is forever weeping about corporate-dominated music, but their only real contribution is their service as Pravdas of genre orthodoxy; what's \"real jazz,\" \"real blues,\" \"real rock 'n' roll,\" blah blah blah."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5f12826-3274-4513-bba3-dbbd1efab448",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "The following is an editorial in today's New York Pravda. My comments are included."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb5263d-6a34-4bfa-911f-d4482a3c06ff",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "Eric Pickles, the new local government secretary, said he wanted to axe 'the weekly town hall Pravdas' to ensure that a healthy independent local press can scrutinise the work of councils."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74d1d735-2743-4448-ab7a-aac4822a2bfd",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "Clinton did not mention Cernovich, but she attacked Alex Jones, the paranoiac Texas radio host, and Breitbart.com, the Pravda of the alt-right."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f822c7b-41b8-450d-a15c-16ad95f7f009",
                                                "sense_id": "46df4e73-e00a-370c-bb3f-b6940840963b",
                                                "text": "Unfund the CBC, Canada's Pravda and national enforcer of truth"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
